{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8330d276248e5618e76fe0d6e75a3a40.poster.avif?t=1763207921\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8330d276248e5618e76fe0d6e75a3a40.webm?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8330d276248e5618e76fe0d6e75a3a40.mp4?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build &amp; Design:\u00a0</strong>Construct your own casino resort skyscraper and customize it to your liking using hundreds of items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decisions:\u00a0</strong>Make tough decisions and choose the best path forward for your resort's success and growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/c30bdf3dc88a8bcde0d2eb4115b15082.poster.avif?t=1763207921\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/c30bdf3dc88a8bcde0d2eb4115b15082.webm?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/c30bdf3dc88a8bcde0d2eb4115b15082.mp4?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Casino Operations:\u00a0</strong>Build and design your own casino within your resort, choose from a variety of games to offer, and assign them to specific areas to attract different types of patrons and increase your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8e56af964a7530545563961f5c2f3a71.poster.avif?t=1763207921\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8e56af964a7530545563961f5c2f3a71.webm?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8e56af964a7530545563961f5c2f3a71.mp4?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory Management:\u00a0</strong>Manage your business inventory and order supplies to ensure that your guests always have what they need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Employee Management:\u00a0</strong>Hire, fire, and manage the shifts of your employees and keep them happy to ensure the smooth operation of your hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/dec6ddf9a13a85bfdd1abbeb1fc2da34.poster.avif?t=1763207921\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/dec6ddf9a13a85bfdd1abbeb1fc2da34.webm?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/dec6ddf9a13a85bfdd1abbeb1fc2da34.mp4?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Utility:\u00a0</strong>Design and manage your hotel's utility systems to keep the lights on and the water flowing smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Townsfolk:\u00a0</strong>Build relationships with the local townsfolk and complete their tasks to earn rewards and improve your reputation in the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/ffdf7db4436468aea2b62896c7aa36d7.poster.avif?t=1763207921\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/ffdf7db4436468aea2b62896c7aa36d7.webm?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/ffdf7db4436468aea2b62896c7aa36d7.mp4?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Menu Design:\u00a0</strong>Create restaurant, bar, cafe, vendor, and vending machine menus to cater to your guests' every taste and preference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Banking &amp; Loans:\u00a0</strong>Manage your hotel's finances, sign loans, and choose from a variety of offers from different banks to keep your hotel running smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/0b9d1e52866f94e3cc5631183d267299.poster.avif?t=1763207921\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/0b9d1e52866f94e3cc5631183d267299.webm?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/0b9d1e52866f94e3cc5631183d267299.mp4?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Security:\u00a0</strong>Keep your guests safe by assigning security patrols, designing CCTV systems, and detaining suspects to prevent different types of crimes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Marketing:\u00a0</strong>Start marketing campaigns by using the marketing documents you've created and attract more guests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/31d09044d808f91e73d33b0eebfde59f.poster.avif?t=1763207921\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/31d09044d808f91e73d33b0eebfde59f.webm?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/31d09044d808f91e73d33b0eebfde59f.mp4?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Office:\u00a0</strong>Build and manage offices to create office documents that you can use while executing administrative orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CEO Office Requests:\u00a0</strong>Complete office requests from your CEO to earn rating points and improve your hotel's</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/3880ea1bfe484f562280fe9f64414c71.poster.avif?t=1763207921\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/3880ea1bfe484f562280fe9f64414c71.webm?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/3880ea1bfe484f562280fe9f64414c71.mp4?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Waste Management:\u00a0</strong>Keep your hotel clean and hygienic by assigning people, creating rooms, and ordering cleaning supplies for the collection and disposal of the waste accumulating around the building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maintenance:\u00a0</strong>Manage the maintenance of the items that break around your hotel and keep everything in good working order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/4e22922668d2e20c06ff53f8703650df.poster.avif?t=1763207921\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/4e22922668d2e20c06ff53f8703650df.webm?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/4e22922668d2e20c06ff53f8703650df.mp4?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Events:\u00a0</strong>Organize different types of events and attract more guests to your hotel, from simple concepts to extravagant parties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Policies:\u00a0</strong>Set rules and policies for your guests and employees to follow to ensure a peaceful and productive hotel environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/fa873798b53d43272d3147301294a4b4.poster.avif?t=1763207921\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/fa873798b53d43272d3147301294a4b4.webm?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/fa873798b53d43272d3147301294a4b4.mp4?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transportation:\u00a0</strong>Build and design taxi ranks, bus stops, metro stations, and parking lots to satisfy your guests' transportation needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Price Management:\u00a0</strong>Manage the prices of your hotel's services and adjust them based on your hotel's rating to keep your guests happy and maximize profits.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":" Master of Mixology","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1457030/84143ea572016029ca4ee757cdbb487f2f15fa56.jpg"},{"name":"Latte Legend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1457030/813a50dc397d14ebfe70b43ce4572344f39c26ba.jpg"},{"name":"Chilled to Perfection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1457030/2eb516425f569e4577e896f71a09e60e2ed752d0.jpg"},{"name":"Hotshot Brewer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1457030/85eba3625d3628afac5f3a5e7a6f8699aad5351b.jpg"},{"name":"Mini-Bar Magnate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1457030/8b594c388b397a9cc59dedb47c991800f7a85a17.jpg"},{"name":"Kitchen Conqueror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1457030/dbee0fc07e863f814fe5e03ef3108923a415fa33.jpg"},{"name":"All-Nighter Empire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1457030/efaa96378f3bdf788b24259bf8734b43623a696c.jpg"},{"name":"Snack Overlord","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1457030/58064ec06f584f593eb2425ff42276c17b73eafc.jpg"},{"name":"Cloud Commander","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1457030/8da40f6f6424a7781473b10011288e2164dc1c3d.jpg"},{"name":"Vendor Virtuoso","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1457030/c4312b11257b0997e23d80edb0c7a5397e18e2c6.jpg"}],"total":74},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1457030?t=1763207921","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/688cc0306f8db251bc23fddb89ef15ae51ba9e79/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763207921","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/8f26f2b2acfef74cf2fb932830fa26eb1ffd98ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763207921","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/8f26f2b2acfef74cf2fb932830fa26eb1ffd98ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763207921","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>THE ROADMAP</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/3f19d4c316e2cbfc0437788b76141941.avif?t=1763207921\" width=780 height=2386 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8330d276248e5618e76fe0d6e75a3a40.poster.avif?t=1763207921\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8330d276248e5618e76fe0d6e75a3a40.webm?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8330d276248e5618e76fe0d6e75a3a40.mp4?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build &amp; Design:\u00a0</strong>Construct your own casino resort skyscraper and customize it to your liking using hundreds of items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decisions:\u00a0</strong>Make tough decisions and choose the best path forward for your resort's success and growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/c30bdf3dc88a8bcde0d2eb4115b15082.poster.avif?t=1763207921\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/c30bdf3dc88a8bcde0d2eb4115b15082.webm?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/c30bdf3dc88a8bcde0d2eb4115b15082.mp4?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Casino Operations:\u00a0</strong>Build and design your own casino within your resort, choose from a variety of games to offer, and assign them to specific areas to attract different types of patrons and increase your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8e56af964a7530545563961f5c2f3a71.poster.avif?t=1763207921\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8e56af964a7530545563961f5c2f3a71.webm?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8e56af964a7530545563961f5c2f3a71.mp4?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory Management:\u00a0</strong>Manage your business inventory and order supplies to ensure that your guests always have what they need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Employee Management:\u00a0</strong>Hire, fire, and manage the shifts of your employees and keep them happy to ensure the smooth operation of your hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/dec6ddf9a13a85bfdd1abbeb1fc2da34.poster.avif?t=1763207921\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/dec6ddf9a13a85bfdd1abbeb1fc2da34.webm?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/dec6ddf9a13a85bfdd1abbeb1fc2da34.mp4?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Utility:\u00a0</strong>Design and manage your hotel's utility systems to keep the lights on and the water flowing smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Townsfolk:\u00a0</strong>Build relationships with the local townsfolk and complete their tasks to earn rewards and improve your reputation in the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/ffdf7db4436468aea2b62896c7aa36d7.poster.avif?t=1763207921\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/ffdf7db4436468aea2b62896c7aa36d7.webm?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/ffdf7db4436468aea2b62896c7aa36d7.mp4?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Menu Design:\u00a0</strong>Create restaurant, bar, cafe, vendor, and vending machine menus to cater to your guests' every taste and preference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Banking &amp; Loans:\u00a0</strong>Manage your hotel's finances, sign loans, and choose from a variety of offers from different banks to keep your hotel running smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/0b9d1e52866f94e3cc5631183d267299.poster.avif?t=1763207921\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/0b9d1e52866f94e3cc5631183d267299.webm?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/0b9d1e52866f94e3cc5631183d267299.mp4?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Security:\u00a0</strong>Keep your guests safe by assigning security patrols, designing CCTV systems, and detaining suspects to prevent different types of crimes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Marketing:\u00a0</strong>Start marketing campaigns by using the marketing documents you've created and attract more guests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/31d09044d808f91e73d33b0eebfde59f.poster.avif?t=1763207921\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/31d09044d808f91e73d33b0eebfde59f.webm?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/31d09044d808f91e73d33b0eebfde59f.mp4?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Office:\u00a0</strong>Build and manage offices to create office documents that you can use while executing administrative orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CEO Office Requests:\u00a0</strong>Complete office requests from your CEO to earn rating points and improve your hotel's</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/3880ea1bfe484f562280fe9f64414c71.poster.avif?t=1763207921\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/3880ea1bfe484f562280fe9f64414c71.webm?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/3880ea1bfe484f562280fe9f64414c71.mp4?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Waste Management:\u00a0</strong>Keep your hotel clean and hygienic by assigning people, creating rooms, and ordering cleaning supplies for the collection and disposal of the waste accumulating around the building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maintenance:\u00a0</strong>Manage the maintenance of the items that break around your hotel and keep everything in good working order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/4e22922668d2e20c06ff53f8703650df.poster.avif?t=1763207921\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/4e22922668d2e20c06ff53f8703650df.webm?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/4e22922668d2e20c06ff53f8703650df.mp4?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Events:\u00a0</strong>Organize different types of events and attract more guests to your hotel, from simple concepts to extravagant parties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Policies:\u00a0</strong>Set rules and policies for your guests and employees to follow to ensure a peaceful and productive hotel environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/fa873798b53d43272d3147301294a4b4.poster.avif?t=1763207921\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/fa873798b53d43272d3147301294a4b4.webm?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/fa873798b53d43272d3147301294a4b4.mp4?t=1763207921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transportation:\u00a0</strong>Build and design taxi ranks, bus stops, metro stations, and parking lots to satisfy your guests' transportation needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Price Management:\u00a0</strong>Manage the prices of your hotel's services and adjust them based on your hotel's rating to keep your guests happy and maximize profits.</p>","developers":["Cyperk Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/b2e2968294785efa0acaa125763e0078efba7d3a/header.jpg?t=1763207921","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright\u00a9 2025 Cyperk Software | All rights reserved","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX 10.13<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4600 (AMD or NVIDIA equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1457030/1229036360/ccd673b52ebb00bc23298b11e2a8d4eabd49417a/1761740194/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761845059","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1457030/1229036360/ccd673b52ebb00bc23298b11e2a8d4eabd49417a/1761740194/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761845059","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1457030/1229036360/ccd673b52ebb00bc23298b11e2a8d4eabd49417a/1761740194/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761845059","id":257224127,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257224127/movie480.mp4?t=1761845059",